Description: Tiny HTTP web-clipboard server
 wclip is a minimal HTTP service that lets clients PUT/POST a body to
 any path and GET it back later with the same content-type. It supports
 a persistent bbolt backend or an in-memory backend, optional HTTP Basic
 Auth, and CORS for browser-based readers.
